  "implemented": [
    "Authenticated physical postimages, exact post-sync durability witnesses, recovered-parent settlement and structural fallback to the prior checked checkpoint.",
    "One sync for eligible bounded native commits, with safe old barriers on overflow, no_sync/deferred/raw/maintenance compatibility and uncertainty fencing.",
    "Recovery-slot horizons retain all required postimages; proof frames and continuation pages retire as metadata independently of logical readers.",
    "Private snapshot copies retire proofs before namespace rebinding, retain added allocator pages and report actual output checkpoint/length.",
    "Typed retired text deletion verifies current inactive membership and durable retirement markers, then atomically unlinks paths and clears markers without rotating semantic generations.",
    "Retirement groups remain separate from authored mutations; bounded optional cleanup yields rather than starting unchecked hard-cap graph proof under its lease."
  ],
